WEBVTT

00:03:27.411 --> 00:03:30.039
let alone type, for years,

00:03:30.039 --> 00:03:32.917
and they so desperately want
to reconnect with their family,

00:03:32.917 --> 00:03:34.085
with their loved ones.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:37.088
You know what the main request we get is?

00:03:37.421 --> 00:03:39.006
Text messaging.

00:03:39.006 --> 00:03:40.299
And then email.

00:03:40.341 --> 00:03:42.551
Control over their smartphone.

00:03:42.593 --> 00:03:44.178
And shock horror,

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.680
social media.

00:03:47.265 --> 00:03:51.185
We've been speaking so much lately
about the flaws of these technologies,

00:03:51.227 --> 00:03:54.188
but for people with paralysis,
this is a return to life.

00:03:55.022 --> 00:03:57.275
BCIs make all of this possible.

00:03:59.235 --> 00:04:00.820
Now, part of the problem has been